  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Indoor Residual Spraying in Malaria Endemic Areas in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To protect over 3.5 million people from malaria by conducting indoor insecticide spraying in high malaria transmission zones in Kenya. This will reduce deaths from malaria thus contributing to achievement of the Millennium Development Goals on reduced child mortality and reduced incidence of major diseases by 2015</narrative>
  </description>
